      Finding signal.<br>
      <span>Building systems.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">I turn financial data into research, trading strategies and software that works in the real world.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="portfolio-button primary" href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="portfolio-button secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/karmakarakash659/">Let’s connect <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-profile">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/img/Akash_pic.jpeg' | relative_url }}" alt="Akash Karmakar" width="52" height="52">
      <p>
        Research meets engineering.<br>
        <span>Python · Quantitative finance · Applied AI</span>
      </p>
